{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52451","headline":"回波乐 九十四 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身是上阵兵，把刀被煞死。\n你若不煞我，我还煞却你。\n两既忽相逢，终须一个死。\n死亦不须忧，生亦不须喜。\n（原本二句互乙）须入湼盘城，速离五浊地。\n天心（张改作「公」）遣我生，地母收我子。\n生死不由我，我是长流水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}